# Claude's working-memory vault: an index over this repo's own memory
# (STATUS.md, reports.txt, README.md), not a source of truth.
#
# It IS committed, deliberately — as of 14 Aug the Ubuntu SSD dual-boots in
# the same laptop and sessions move between the two, so a Windows-only vault
# would arrive empty on the machine doing the work.
#
# BEFORE MAKING THIS REPO PUBLIC AT SUBMISSION, untrack it:
#     git rm -r --cached vault/
#     # then re-add the line `vault/` below this comment block
# The files stay on disk; the working tree stops showing them. See
# vault/00-how-i-use-this.md.
